# Design Principles

The website should maintain a professional B2B appearance.

The design should communicate:

* Trust
* Professionalism
* Reliability
* International capability
* Simplicity
* Modern business services
* UK business credibility

The website should avoid looking like a generic recruitment template.

---

# Navigation

The main navigation should provide direct links to the individual pages.

Example:

```text
Home
About
Services
How It Works
Contact
```

Each navigation item should take the visitor to the appropriate page.

For example:

```text
About → about.html
Services → services.html
Contact → contact.html
Home → index.html
```

---

# Responsive Design

The website should work correctly on:

* Desktop computers
* Laptops
* Tablets
* Mobile phones

The CSS should use responsive layouts and media queries where appropriate.

Example:

```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    /* Mobile styles */
}
```

---

# SEO

Each page should contain appropriate:

* `<title>`
* Meta description
* Heading structure
* Semantic HTML
* Descriptive links
* Image `alt` attributes

Example:

```html
<title>AVERRA Staffing Solutions | UK Staffing & Outsourcing</title>

<meta
    name="description"
    content="AVERRA Staffing Solutions connects UK businesses with skilled global talent through flexible staffing and outsourcing solutions."
>
```

SEO should focus on relevant search terms such as:

* UK outsourcing
* UK staffing solutions
* remote staffing
* international staffing
* outsourcing to India
* remote employees
* virtual employees UK
* offshore staffing
* finance outsourcing
* accounting outsourcing
* remote finance professionals

