# Business Model

AVERRA operates as a UK staffing and outsourcing business.

The general model is:

```text
UK Business
     │
     ▼
   AVERRA
     │
     ▼
International Talent
     │
     ▼
Remote Delivery
```

A UK client can engage AVERRA when it needs additional staff without directly managing the overseas recruitment process.

AVERRA can support the client with:

1. Understanding the staffing requirement
2. Identifying suitable candidates
3. Candidate screening
4. Client introductions
5. Placement
6. Contractual arrangements
7. Ongoing staffing support

