# Development Rules

When adding new pages:

1. Create the HTML file.
2. Add the correct navigation.
3. Link the page to `style.css`.
4. Add a unique page title.
5. Add a meta description.
6. Maintain the same header and footer.
7. Check desktop layout.
8. Check mobile layout.
9. Test every navigation link.
10. Check spelling and content before publishing.

